{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Decision recorded 2026-10-27 (operator): option 1 — make venv verifies the pinned uv's version against [tool.uv] required-version and, on mismatch, repairs the pin by fetching the required release into the pin directory. Fetching a release binary during bootstrap is accepted for this repo. The fetch must be CI-provider-independent and must verify the download before replacing the binary."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793146907190075073,"uuid":"41809b3f-834b-4210-b1b7-166a217652d3"}